<title>LATVIA: LIEPAJA FISH CANNERY IN BIGGER 1996 LOSS.</title>
<headline>LIEPAJA FISH CANNERY IN BIGGER 1996 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liepaja fish cannery posted a 201,037 lat loss in 1996, worsening the 1995 loss of 66,901 lats, the stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the bourse said Liepaja's net turnover grew in 1996 to 1.19 million lats against 215,137 lats the previous year.</p>
<p>The company's balance sheet volume was 832,096 lats against 970,146 lats in 1995, the stock exchange added.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
